<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01258#stereotype_of_men_as_protectors_of_traditional_gender_roles> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme assumes that men are expected to uphold traditional gender roles and norms, and that their offense at the woman smoking is a sign of their adherence to these roles. This stereotype is used to frame the men"@en .
