<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01258#semiotic_projection_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text 'ladies!' explicitly addresses the user/viewer as part of the target demographic. The user is projected onto the group of women being addressed, who are expected to identify with the message and apply it to their own experiences or relationships. The projection is onto the textual material that directly addresses 'ladies' and implicitly onto the visual material (the woman) as a representative example for this group."@en .
