<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01258#contempt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The woman's facial expression, combined with the act of smoking and the defiant posture, conveys a sense of contempt or disdain, particularly towards the societal norms or expectations she is challenging. Her gaze and the smoky atmosphere reinforce this emotion."@en .
