<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01258#toxicity_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme delivers a direct attack on men based on their sexual orientation, using degrading language ('faggot') and a stereotypical visual (a woman smoking) to reinforce a harmful stereotype. This is a hateful message targeting individuals based on protected characteristics."@en .
